Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.15,0:00:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都清楚我们可能需要谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You both know who we might need.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来帮忙应付黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help deal with the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是梅塔特隆 那个大名鼎鼎的梅塔特隆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Metatron? The Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.25,0:00:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是大天使 我是神的书记员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not an archangel, I'm the scribe of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰克·雪利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck Shurley?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是上帝的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a prophet of the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道先知都是怎么选出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how prophets are chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不想做什么先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 谁也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 显然我是上帝 - 你不是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Obviously, I'm a god. - You're not a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我们能完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hoping that you and I can finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.11,0:00:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几个月前开始进行的创作\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I started a few months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间之初时 你不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't alone in the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是原初 也将会是终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the beginning, and I will be the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会成为唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be all that there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是紧密相连的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bonded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是释放了我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who set me free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,得先让路西法去对付阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our priority is to set Lucifer loose on Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要先把路西法从小卡身体里驱逐出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}After we exorcise Lucifer out of Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.27,0:00:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把他放进新皮囊里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put him into a new vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用 路西法对他的控制太强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Useless. Lucifer's hold on him is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大天使加上上帝之力 并不能打败上帝的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archangel plus God power doesn't trump God's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.63,0:00:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你和我得好好地长谈一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you and I need to have a nice long chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.63,0:01:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果阿玛拉抹去重启 就把什么都毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Amara wipes the slate, everything is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我搭档见识过这种情况 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My partner and I have seen this before, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.55,0:01:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦斯 哈里斯警官是被浓雾里的东西感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wes, Deputy Harris were infected by something in this fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.27,0:01:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,护身符 它能感应到上帝的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The amulet … it burns hot in God's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是因为这个才回来了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's why you're back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.63,0:01:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是她的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't her story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:17.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这究竟是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on here, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.85,0:01:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意说明情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy to… fill in the blanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.51,0:01:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但或许我们该去个可以坐下来谈谈的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}but maybe we should go somewhere where we could actually sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.09,0:01:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不要跟你去任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going anywhere with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道你是真的恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, how do we even know that you're really Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是什么疯狂的咒语或是幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not just some crazy spell or manifest…ation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.46,0:01:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们貌似压力很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:01:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:01:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信恰克吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他需要你们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is he needs you to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定是觉得你们做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}he must think you can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.18,0:02:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 结果多好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that ended well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.39,0:02:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 考虑到全部情况吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I mean, you know, given the circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't mean to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.61,0:02:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事情还挺多的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of a plateful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.57,0:02:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Kevin…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been in the Veil long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该升级了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time you had an upgrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第11季第21集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:02:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, wow, um, Chuck …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们不能那么喊你 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we don't call you that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.85,0:03:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就是「恰克」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, "Chuck" it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. You're gonna have to, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我和迪恩点时间消化\N{\fnArial\fs30}give Dean and me a moment to start to process.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道你还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't even know you were around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道恰克 但我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we knew about Chuck, but we just didn't know about…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.92,0:03:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直希望你是在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I-I-I was hoping you were around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷了 不知道你是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I prayed and I … but I don't know if they got, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.90,0:03:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埋在垃圾邮件里了 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lost in the spam or if - Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 话太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Babbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.31,0:03:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白不是每个人都觉得满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting that not everyone's totally on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the thing, um…Chuck…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I mean no disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你回来是为了帮忙黑暗的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing you came back to help with the Darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.85,0:04:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, you know … It's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.85,0:04:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, but you've been gone a … a…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}long, long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几千年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's so much crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.05,0:04:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that has gone down on the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多破事\N{\fnArial\fs30}for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,瘟疫 战争 屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, plagues and wars, slaughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在…写书吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were, I don't know, writing books,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加粉丝大会\N{\fnArial\fs30}going to fan conventions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道外面都发生什么了吗 还是把那些屏蔽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you even aware, o-or did you just tune it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was aware, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.53,0:04:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一次 我不是想惹你生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, again, I-I'm not trying to piss you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想变成枕头或者盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't want to turn into a pillar of salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.93,0:04:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 那个不是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually … I didn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.18,0:04:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们都对你祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}People … People pray to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们为你建教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}People build churches for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你发起战争 你却什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fight wars in your name, and you did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我原本亲力亲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I was hands-on …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real hands-on for,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了好久\N{\fnArial\fs30}wow, ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.69,0:05:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为 如果我一直插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so sure if I kept stepping in,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,教导 惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}teaching, punishing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.07,0:05:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些我创造的美妙生灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}that these beautiful creatures that I created…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}would grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.14,0:05:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们却没变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it only stayed the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白我必须离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I saw that I needed to step away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.56,0:05:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我的宝宝自己找到路\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let my baby find its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,过度干涉已经不是为父之道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being overinvolved is no longer parenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是要把控制权交给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's enabling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但情况并没好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it didn't get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:06:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've been mulling it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我看来 我觉得是变好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from where I sit, I think it has.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我看来 像是你抛弃了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, from where I sit, it feels like you left us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后给自己找借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're trying to justify it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.65,0:06:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你小时候过得不容易 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you had a complicated upbringing, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.49,0:06:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别把我当成你爸爸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but don't confuse me with your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.24,0:06:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束你的痛苦吧 路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}End your suffering, Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤他出来 求他救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call out to him. Beg him to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我求爸爸来救他的完蛋儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want me to beg daddy to come rescue his screw-up of a son?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怎么喜欢老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no fan of Pops,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的确创造了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he did make all of…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这是你永远做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's something that you could never do,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你一直以来只想要虚无\N{\fnArial\fs30}because all you ever wanted was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不怎么激励人 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not too inspiring, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很厉害 阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're strong, Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许能击败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你永远成不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will never be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得明白黑暗的这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to understand this about the Darkness …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's relentless,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一股人类无法理解的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}a force beyond human comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.75,0:07:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only reason I came off the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.71,0:07:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,做她哥哥感觉很棒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have been great being her brother, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.35,0:07:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,总对我指手画脚 要我按她说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always telling me what to do, making me do what she wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you guys know how that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}No freakin' idea, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.90,0:07:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对自己做了防护 让我找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's warded herself specifically against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们查到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you come up with?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.78,0:08:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我们都查了几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zip, and we've been at it for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直相信你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always had faith in you…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.53,0:08:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便你们不相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…even if you didn't return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.59,0:08:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,客房在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the guest room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.91,0:08:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要洗个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿走廊 左边第四扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}just down the hallway … the fourth door on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.15,0:08:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她抓了路西法吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that she's got Lucifer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.77,0:08:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我们听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way we heard it, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次把黑暗关起来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}last time when you bottled up the Darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是凭你一人之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}it … it took more than just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.82,0:08:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说路西法也帮忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we heard that Lucifer was involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.91,0:08:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.00,0:09:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法或许曾是我最大的期望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer was perhaps my greatest hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是我最深的失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my bitterest disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得如果我能信任他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think if I could have trusted him for a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会把他关进笼子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have put him in the Cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.16,0:09:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本不想提的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wasn't gonna mention this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.24,0:09:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是多谢你们把他弄出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but thank you so much for springing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.68,0:09:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是计划好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't really the plan, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他之前虽然糟糕 但关了那么久的监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as bad as he was, after all this time in prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.49,0:09:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在大概更糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's probably worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 他或许已跟阿玛拉成了盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by now, he could have formed an alliance with Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别去闯陷阱 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not walking into that trap, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.69,0:09:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,主如是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus spake the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, always is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是新的 有什么变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is new. Something's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许老爸注意到了你最近的疯狂屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Dad picked up ‭on your latest slaughterfest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.89,0:09:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,宠坏的熊孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoiled brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要安宁 他却想要粉丝俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed solitude ‭and he needed a fan club,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.29,0:09:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是他创造了那堆东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he made all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when I complained,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:10:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就跟你一起把我塞进一个洞里 关了那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}he stuffed me in a hole for eons … with your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别抱怨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.71,0:10:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要听你责备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 阿玛拉 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Amara. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've missed you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好久没说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while since we've spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我哥哥出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware my brother has surfaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.01,0:10:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们碰到了 如果他来找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you should cross paths, if he should reach out to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}he should know this …
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.25,0:11:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法 他的宠儿 现在状况不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer, his favorite, isn't doing so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.45,0:11:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别提那具皮囊 你的朋友卡西迪奥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say nothing of the vessel, your friend Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.81,0:11:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥无视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}By choosing to ignore me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.05,0:11:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是在纵容这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother is allowing this to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他事\N{\fnArial\fs30}These and… other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:35.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄克拉荷马州 刘易斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.17,0:12:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.65,0:12:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.39,0:12:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 谢谢 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, thanks. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I can't believe I'm gonna say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我这次真希望罗威娜在\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, for once, I actually wish Rowena was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许她能找到阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe she could track down Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以前就成功过\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's done it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:41.36,Title,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但可以打赌 她和《诅咒之书》会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you can bet she and the Book are gonna stay stashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直躲到事情平息\N{\fnArial\fs30}until this whole thing is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰克呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Chuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡懒觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleeping in, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝还睡觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does God sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他洗澡的时间特别长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he takes really long showers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:13:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 还唱歌 难听的老民歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, and sings, too … like, crappy old folk songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我三次叫他消停点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to tell him to cool it three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.98,0:13:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫上帝消停点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told God to cool it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.75,0:13:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我还要睡觉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道现在情况很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I know this is a really strange situation and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.65,0:13:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也挺有意思的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's also really amazing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.25,0:13:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有好多话想问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so many things I want to ask him,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, like, uh, t-the planets, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.40,0:13:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是圆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are they round?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有耳朵 我一直觉得耳朵很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or ears. I always thought they were strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 迷弟 冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fanboy, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧找到路西法 否则要来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find Lucifer before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.01,0:13:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉 她进入了我的头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara is … she's in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.01,0:13:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想的 她突然就出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I didn't ask for it, okay? She just showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她让我看到了路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's showing me visions of … of Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是小卡 他的样子糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By Lucifer, I mean Cass, and he looks like crap …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.61,0:13:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她对他真的伤得不轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}like she's really doing a number on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.73,0:13:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,早啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的睡袍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that my robe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.65,0:13:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟路西法搅到一起是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a mistake to get mixed up with Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我也很痛苦 但我不得不离开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much as it pained me, I had to walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.39,0:14:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,太闹腾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.77,0:14:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有培根吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any bacon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃培根\N{\fnArial\fs30}You eat bacon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.29,0:14:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 两位 新情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Hey, guys, this just came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来阿玛拉迷雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like that fog, the, um… Amara fog,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.82,0:14:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,又侵袭了一座小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, hit another town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.95,0:14:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.21,0:14:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座小镇不像上一座那么幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this one wasn't as lucky as the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,数千人死亡 每个人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands died. Uh, everybody died.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, except for one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you miss that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.41,0:14:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想诱我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's baiting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.28,0:14:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能次次都回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't respond every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要受她摆布\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be manipulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但死了数千人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but thousands of people are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为您带来关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have breaking news at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近一起怪异天气事件的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the most recent freak weather event.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,州警现在证实一股神秘毒雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}State police are now confirming that a mysterious toxic fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚笼罩了俄克拉荷马州刘易斯镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}engulfed the town of Lewis, Oklahoma, late last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.98,0:14:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,据报 有大量人员死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reports are also confirmed there were mass fatalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这起毒雾事件跟几天前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Descriptions of the event are identical to those.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭遇毒雾侵袭的另一座小镇的情况相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the fog that overwhelmed another town in the days …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:04.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（神秘毒雾再次袭来 俄克拉荷马州刘易斯被毒雾笼罩）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:25.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（书记员来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现你们跟恰克有接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}I notice you've been in touched with Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've got some…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.84,0:15:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要知道情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}information you're gonna need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.07,0:15:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.61,0:15:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,得当面说 我得带你们去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be in person … something I got to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.05,0:15:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉德费尔德教授 我们是联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Redfield. FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:15:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫我多纳泰罗就好 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call me Donatello. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.03,0:16:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名字是随他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm named after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.41,0:16:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍者神龟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mutant Ninja Turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,文艺复兴时期的雕刻家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh, Renaissance sculptor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察当我是恐怖分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cops think I'm a terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在大学教化学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I teach chemistry at the university.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活很宁静 还养了猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I lead a quiet life. I have a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.70,0:16:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对此深表遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we are, uh, sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想问几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了毒雾 你那晚还发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, other than the fog, did you notice anything or anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,街上有什么异常的情况或人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that seemed out of place on the street that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切发生的好快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It … It all happened so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.95,0:16:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那雾简直像无端冒出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like it came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很少有雾 而且从没有那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hardly ever get fog, and never like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.99,0:16:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都掐着喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were clutching their throats.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.27,0:16:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像喘不过气\N{\fnArial\fs30}like … like … like they were choking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的身体 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their bodies … Oh, my God …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:17:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,显现出骇人的黑色条纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}these terrible black streaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我从没体验过的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like nothing I've ever felt before in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像我的头要爆炸了 但不是因为疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like my head was exploding, only not with pain …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.31,0:17:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是因为大量的知识 看清了很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}with … with … with knowledge and … and clarity!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我根本不知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things that I'd never known before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.75,0:17:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,符号 声音 我根本不会的语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Symbols and … and voices … in languages I don't speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.60,0:17:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}horrible…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常可怕的幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}horrible visions…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.17,0:17:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}of destruction…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,和死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.82,0:17:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.96,0:17:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 完全没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, uh, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.45,0:17:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我们单独谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, you know, will you give us a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.98,0:18:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现这听起来很耳熟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you get that this is all sounding familiar, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.21,0:18:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 就像凯文发现自己是先知的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, like when Kevin found out he was a prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这人是个先知吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, this guy's a prophet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.49,0:18:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但克劳力之前不是把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I thought Crowley rounded up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的潜在先知都抓起来想杀掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the future prophets and tried to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.89,0:18:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们救了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we rescued them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.99,0:18:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,多纳泰罗当时可不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Donatello wasn't a part of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.19,0:18:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是啊 克劳力有可能漏了几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, yeah, it's possible Crowley missed a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 他并不知道自己排在凯文之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, obviously, he had no idea he was next in line after Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么能知道 他当时还没被上帝之力击中呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would he? He hadn't gotten hit by the God power yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉的迷雾\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Amara's fog …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会不会是阿玛拉的神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}could it have been Amara's God power?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也还是神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still God power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.66,0:18:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我得来杯咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I need a coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被捕了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am … am I under arrest?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是想再核实一下你的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}want to check out a few more aspects of your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.29,0:18:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你看下这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Would you look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量去解读一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and read it a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我读不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I can't. I …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.56,0:18:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对此毫无了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.81,0:18:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,「请看上帝」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Behold the face of God""
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:18:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一下就想到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That came right to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.31,0:19:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是谁的语言 - 天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who speaks this language? - Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得见你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.34,0:19:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情发生得很快 一切都会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Events are moving swiftly and everything will change.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.58,0:19:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得跟你见面 但不能这样见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to meet with you, but not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,单独见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.77,0:19:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能是先知 我是无神论者 化学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}I can't b'ta prophet. I'm an atheist and a chemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信分子 不是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I believe in molecules, not God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 按说先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, we're pretty sure that prophets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.43,0:19:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是不知情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't even know they're in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.59,0:19:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他们被上帝点化\N{\fnArial\fs30}until they've actually been touched by God, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝点化了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I was touched by God?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.69,0:19:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是他妹妹 阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or possibly his sister, Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还有家人啊 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He has family? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想干掉他 好毁灭宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants him gone so she can annihilate the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大致是如此 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the headline. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.09,0:19:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于你可能与她有直接的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since you might have a hotline to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望你能帮我们找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're hoping you can help us find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.57,0:19:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么要找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-Why would you want to find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.32,0:19:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得救一个被她扣押的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to rescue this guy she's holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.14,0:19:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁 - 路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is? - Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她侄子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.05,0:20:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他目前附身了一个天使 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's possessing an angel at the moment. - ‭Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.73,0:20:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我们会把妖怪放在车后座\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes we keep monsters in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I … I … I can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.34,0:20:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你行的 - 我真的不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, you can. - No, I promise you I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.53,0:20:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能逼你 你得自己想做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can't force you to do this. You've got to want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.97,0:20:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就像让我相信圣诞老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It … It's like asking me to believe in Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其实… - 迪恩 不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, well, actually … - Dean, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.69,0:20:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们不求你相信这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, we … we're not asking you to believe that this is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,装装样子就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}just act like you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们成天装相\N{\fnArial\fs30}People do it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.11,0:20:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I … I-I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像感觉到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I … I think I'm sensing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.28,0:20:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.44,0:20:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Amara?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.75,0:20:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.42,0:20:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我怎么可能知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, how would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.94,0:20:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could it be…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.75,0:20:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.05,0:21:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh, found someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像是下一位先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's the next prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.13,0:21:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好诶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neat-o.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.03,0:21:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的电脑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that my computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过那么多黄片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen so much porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.16,0:21:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少没一次性见过那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in one sitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.86,0:21:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's … I'm gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对这神神鬼鬼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He … He's … He's a little nutted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.62,0:21:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,状况有点抓狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the whole booga-booga of it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.09,0:21:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许别拿上帝什么的吓他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so maybe just dial back the … the God stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.43,0:21:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没穿裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pants on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.13,0:21:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.29,0:21:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你安全了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you're safe. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,多纳泰罗 见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donatello, good to see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.29,0:21:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猫的事我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about your cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.84,0:22:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You … You know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.72,0:22:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我创造了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我创造了你们所有人 包括那些尚未出世的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made all of you, even the ones who aren't born yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.00,0:22:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你很高兴 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}G-Good to meet you, Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.00,0:22:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大神明殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your … Your celestial magnificence, your …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.60,0:22:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,喊他恰克就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}He … He just kind of goes by Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.72,0:22:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了吧 你加入吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we good? Y'all signed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.79,0:22:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你知道我本是个无神论者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I guess you know that I was an atheist,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.57,0:22:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到10分钟前\N{\fnArial\fs30}until 10 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.30,0:22:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that an issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.39,0:22:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不介意 我相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for me. ‭I mean, I believe in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.19,0:22:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的怀疑是预料之中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your skepticism is to be expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.57,0:22:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟我还给了人自由意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did include free will in the kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.01,0:22:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.06,0:22:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板 来点玛格丽塔酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, barkeep, dos margaritas!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.44,0:23:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿最棒的龙舌兰给我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top-shelf tequila please for my amigos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.51,0:23:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们请客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.53,0:23:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.77,0:23:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了 别耍花样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here. ‭Don't try to pull any crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.25,0:23:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能耍什么花样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what variety of crap could I possibly pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.95,0:23:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经没有能量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost my grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.53,0:23:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我啊 我什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.67,0:23:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你为什么非要见我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, why did you have to see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.21,0:23:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事那么急\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so urgent?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现你们见到了恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I, uh, notice you've been in touch with Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.57,0:23:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是那个谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}A.K.A., you know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.92,0:23:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你有什么话想说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Is this going anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.65,0:23:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 恰克同意对付阿玛拉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Chuck agreed to take on Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.47,0:23:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.84,0:23:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是他原话吗 - 差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Used those words? - Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.31,0:23:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 他不打算对付阿玛拉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what … ‭he's not confronting Amara?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.12,0:23:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的确是要去见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's … He's going to … He's gonna…meet with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.01,0:23:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不会干掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just not gonna take her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.55,0:23:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.14,0:23:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}sacrifice himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.86,0:23:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,任凭她处置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her do whatever she wants with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.00,0:24:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真指望我们相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really expect us to buy this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.00,0:24:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.10,0:24:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.06,0:24:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.33,0:24:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,信这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.41,0:24:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管错别字 但好好读读\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignore the typos, but read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.77,0:24:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是他自己的原话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in his own words.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.65,0:24:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是自传\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not an autobiography.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.11,0:24:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是遗书\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a suicide note.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.35,0:24:33.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（上帝 一本自传）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.04,0:24:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}You wanted to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.15,0:24:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里似乎就不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This seemed as good a place as any.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.32,0:24:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他们 多么乐观\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at them … endlessly optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.26,0:24:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,风吹倒他的塔楼 他就重建\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wind blows over his tower, he rebuilds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.99,0:25:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,总能触动我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always gets me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.32,0:25:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是这样 你为什么要放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's so, why are you bailing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.19,0:25:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见到阿玛拉时 就要投降吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you see Amara, you're throwing in the towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.21,0:25:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.68,0:25:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大嘴巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loose lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.25,0:25:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你觉得我是混蛋呢 你在乎个什么劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you think I'm a dick. Why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.13,0:25:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你失踪之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because before you went M.I.A…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.92,0:25:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}you did a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.82,0:25:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.94,0:25:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所谓的投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what you call throwing in the towel,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.92,0:25:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来是策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.49,0:25:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你妹妹杀死怎么能叫策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is death by your sister a strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.39,0:25:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.18,0:25:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是跟我有仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her beef is with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.14,0:25:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但我还是不明白 死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I still don't understand how … how dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.38,0:25:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么能塑造成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a … ‭a blueprint for success.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.03,0:25:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't be dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.30,0:25:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会被囚禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be caged.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.27,0:26:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿自己换我创造的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trade myself for… everything I created.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.63,0:26:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界得以延续\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.28,0:26:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, the, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.23,0:26:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识的那个阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara that I know is…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.44,0:26:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}a mountain of … of pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.21,0:26:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一个人被关了那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she spent a … a gazillion years in solitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.27,0:26:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她唯一的想法就是 现在轮到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing she's thinking is … is it's her turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.62,0:26:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给她机会 只要她接受交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll give it to her, as long as she accepts the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.56,0:26:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deal? What…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.17,0:26:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会毁灭你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna eliminate you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.40,0:26:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她会毁掉你创造的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then she's gonna destroy everything that you've created.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.32,0:26:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是她亲口跟我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's told me this personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.67,0:26:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切是你创造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You started this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.39,0:26:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部是你创造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You started all of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.95,0:26:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你就有权终结它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but does that give you the right to end it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.68,0:26:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是你可以随手丢掉的玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we're not just some toys you throw away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.77,0:26:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你欠我们更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you owe us more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.04,0:26:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我的计划不成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my plan doesn't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.16,0:26:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人类就会站出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}then humans will step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.14,0:27:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.87,0:27:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他天选者 得找到办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}others that are the chosen will have to find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.45,0:27:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我那么多年前救了你的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why I saved you years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.47,0:27:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是光明和黑暗之间的防火墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the firewall ‭between light and darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.95,0:27:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.86,0:27:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.95,0:27:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 吸血鬼 我对付得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, give me a … a vampire, and I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.23,0:27:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 上帝的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this … God's sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.98,0:27:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太超出我的能力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is way above my pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.67,0:27:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.51,0:27:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}It…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.96,0:27:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 是你该来干掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottom line is i-it's you who has to take her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.11,0:27:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look, and then after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.12,0:27:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是去坎昆买间公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, get a condo in Cancun.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.57,0:27:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.12,0:27:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你拿了瓶啤酒 不知道你喝不喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you a beer. ‭I don't know if you drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.46,0:27:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在喝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.78,0:28:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.68,0:28:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道恰克是不是会站在我们这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know… ‭If Chuck is leaning our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.14,0:28:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.94,0:28:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们真把路西法弄来一起帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we do get Lucifer for the added muscle,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.70,0:28:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他或许会配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}then…maybe he'll play ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.07,0:28:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是敌视彼此吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought they hated each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.25,0:28:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.34,0:28:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真怀念做个无神论者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I so miss being an atheist.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.52,0:28:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 梅塔特隆 快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Metatron. Make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.61,0:28:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.13,0:28:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.72,0:28:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.73,0:28:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢请我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for inviting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.86,0:28:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inviting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.42,0:28:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一晚上都在地堡外面转悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been circling the building all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.75,0:28:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我发了两百条傻逼符号表情的短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent me 200 text messages with dumbass emojis.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.40,0:28:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.25,0:28:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,多纳泰罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donatello!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.18,0:28:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.98,0:28:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆 我是上帝的书记员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron, scribe of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.22,0:28:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被设计出来时我就在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there when you were designed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.17,0:29:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你的名字写在了天使眼皮内侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wrote your name on the inside of the angels' eyelids.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.64,0:29:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要吓尿我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.34,0:29:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你说想帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. ‭You said you wanted to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.62,0:29:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了世界级二逼 你还有什么能提供的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides world-class douchery, what do you have to offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.67,0:29:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.22,0:29:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是抄录了天使石碑 知道所有的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just transcribed the angel tablet and know all the spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.07,0:29:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解阿玛拉的心思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know what makes Amara tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.95,0:29:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟大老板认识很久很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I had a relationship with the big guy for eons.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.75,0:29:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要继续说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.33,0:29:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.20,0:29:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我不愿承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as I hate to admit this…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.18,0:29:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他说的有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}he kind of has a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.36,0:29:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.28,0:29:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要一切的帮助 哪怕是二逼的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need all the help you can get … even douche help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.28,0:29:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候站在上帝这边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since when did you jump on the God wagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.21,0:29:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前根本不在乎啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never used to give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.74,0:29:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经是不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I didn't … at one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.20,0:29:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他视死如归了 要把我们留给黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that he's gone all kamikaze, leaving us with the Darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.65,0:29:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.23,0:29:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自创世之初就在他身旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was by his side since the creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.92,0:29:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believed in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.02,0:30:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能帮忙拯救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's something I can do to help save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.73,0:30:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他的创造 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his creation, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.57,0:30:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我似乎就该那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}…uh, it seems like I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.19,0:30:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们计划把路西法从阿玛拉那儿救走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan is to rescue Lucifer from Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.50,0:30:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让他把我们从阿玛拉的藏身处瞬移出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he teleports us out of Amara's hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.04,0:30:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们说服恰克和他一起去打她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we convince Chuck to use him to fight her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.81,0:30:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.75,0:30:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道阿玛拉在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know where Amara is?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.86,0:30:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能知道她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I think I might know where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.92,0:30:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直有种感应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been getting this vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.31,0:30:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像我大脑皮层里有一股电脉冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's like a ping in my cerebral cortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.71,0:30:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么可能是阿玛拉 也可能是中风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so either Amara or a stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.71,0:30:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么拖住阿玛拉 然后去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are we supposed to keep Amara busy while we're…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.08,0:30:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,解救路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}liberating Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.58,0:31:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢联系我 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for reaching out to me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.08,0:31:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你想见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wanted to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.11,0:31:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.76,0:31:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你给我的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the… sensations you arouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.40,0:31:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你也有同样的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.00,0:31:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.57,0:31:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can be no us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.75,0:31:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该各自走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should just walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.72,0:31:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.33,0:32:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, goody.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.00,0:32:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个臭皮匠啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry, Curly, Moe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.96,0:32:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜寻营救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search and rescue?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.03,0:32:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是老爸最喜欢的之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of Dad's favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.65,0:32:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ticket finally got punched, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.76,0:32:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's wacky, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.38,0:33:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,前一秒 你还谁都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute, you're…nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.79,0:33:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 你一下就变成圣女贞德了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then … Shazam … you're Joan of Arc.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.39,0:33:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这次的结局能更好点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's, uh … Let's hope this ends better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.88,0:33:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 寒暄够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, can the small talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.94,0:33:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要救你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're busting you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.48,0:33:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it seems fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.45,0:33:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你们几个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}since I wouldn't be here if you lunatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.17,0:33:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,设的局才害我被阿玛拉抓走\N{\fnArial\fs30}hadn't set me up to be grabbed by Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.11,0:33:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得帮我们干掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna help us take her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.69,0:33:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你拒绝 我们就把你丢在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say no, we'll just leave you here in Abu Ghraib.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.05,0:33:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.17,0:33:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到她对我做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what she's done to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.74,0:33:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我喜欢她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like a fan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.01,0:33:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方 这世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place, this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.46,0:33:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你过得不怎么容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}hasn't been especially easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.88,0:33:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不至少考虑下我的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not at least consider my offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.20,0:33:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界的确不完美 我承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}This world is flawed. I will give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.72,0:33:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还没准备好跟它告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am not ready to say goodbye to it just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.15,0:33:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不管怎样 你都得跟它道别\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one way or the other, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.42,0:33:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不可避免的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.55,0:34:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥别想再次阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother won't stop me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.68,0:34:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.85,0:34:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 放弃你的渺小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, give up your… smallness,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.78,0:34:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人性吧 加入我 成为无限\N{\fnArial\fs30}your humanity and become boundless within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.69,0:34:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.19,0:34:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从速记员群里把他揪出来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you grabbed this from the steno pool?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.45,0:34:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白你要跟你父亲一起联手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand you'll be working with your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.75,0:34:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that gonna be a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.26,0:34:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是家仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.53,0:34:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.72,0:34:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会暂且搁置以前的宿怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you'll table all the old stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.40,0:34:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂的麻烦都留在天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens in Heaven stays in Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.80,0:34:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.98,0:34:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆 怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron, are we getting any closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.80,0:34:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩不能一直拖下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean can't stall forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.16,0:34:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在筛选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm … I'm … I'm narrowing it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.49,0:34:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 我是受你吸引\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. I am drawn to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.98,0:34:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我很烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it bothers the hell out of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.64,0:34:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不能自控\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I can't control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.15,0:34:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那何必抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why fight it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.11,0:35:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.48,0:35:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我是你挣扎的终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that I am the end of your struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.58,0:35:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么阻止了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something stops you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.31,0:35:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你不能得到一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps you from having it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.76,0:35:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.24,0:35:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.06,0:35:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.09,0:35:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.32,0:35:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法 快把我们瞬移出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lucifer, zap us out of here … quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.34,0:35:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.57,0:35:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean you can't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.69,0:35:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时禁足了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temporarily grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.97,0:35:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,设备故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Equipment malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.04,0:35:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟上帝说过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've spoken with God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.24,0:35:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.91,0:36:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.34,0:36:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 我能感觉到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I'm … I'm feeling her!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.92,0:36:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.81,0:36:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们快走 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're out of here. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.98,0:36:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.34,0:36:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 梅塔特隆 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Metatron, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.97,0:36:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 萨姆 你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Sam. You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.40,0:36:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.57,0:36:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.21,0:36:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来应付她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.93,0:36:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,书记员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.33,0:37:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那是在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were kidding with that, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.84,0:37:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He meant well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.41,0:37:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别毁了宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.69,0:37:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.12,0:38:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不值得我放过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really aren't worth sparing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.49,0:38:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都不配\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.93,0:38:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.69,0:38:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.60,0:39:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.22,0:39:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偶尔是会回应祈祷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Occasionally, I do answer a prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.76,0:39:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.32,0:39:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.79,0:39:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, still…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.28,0:39:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没怎么变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really pretty much the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.25,0:40:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还觉得紧张 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Still twitchy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.81,0:40:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过了上帝 路西法 黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you met God, Lucifer, and the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.13,0:40:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得去水疗好好泡一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need a spa day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.35,0:40:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就找一对儿妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}That or a pair of hookers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.25,0:40:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去理清思路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I have to sort it all out,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.50,0:40:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看接下来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}see what comes next.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.84,0:40:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太想回归学术界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel much like returning to academia,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.79,0:40:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不能再做回无神论者了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I sure as hell can't go back to being an atheist.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.73,0:40:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hear ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.68,0:40:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢…吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you…I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.52,0:40:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.77,0:40:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有明天 鉴于你们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there is a tomorrow, given your line of work,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.61,0:40:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大概还会再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll probably see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.64,0:40:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别消失 我们或许还用得上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay tuned. We may need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.18,0:40:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆为大家牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Metatron took one for the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.20,0:40:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 真是没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - ‭Well, I wouldn't have called that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.38,0:40:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想跟我说说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you want to tell me about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.12,0:40:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉显然是察觉到不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Amara obviously figured out something was going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.08,0:40:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她没杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she didn't rip your head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.36,0:41:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要我成为她的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants me to be a part of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.94,0:41:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是隐喻 是真的合体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not metaphorically, I'm talking literally …
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.78,0:41:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远合体\N{\fnArial\fs30}forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.53,0:41:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So in other words, adios.
